# Cloudflare Pages — no redirect rules.
#
# Client-side routes such as /billing need no rule here. With no 404.html at
# the top of the site, Pages serves index.html for any path that isn't a file
# (its single-page-app mode), and React Router takes over. Pages drops a
# `/* /index.html 200` rule as an infinite loop, so don't add one.
#
# assets/404.html keeps missing /assets/ files out of that fallback.
